   "source": [
    "### 3.2. Identify and handle outliers <a id=\"data_preprocessing_2\"></a>\n",
    "![image.png](attachment:image.png) \\\n",
    "prompt chatGPT: \"When to use Z-Score Threshold, when to use IQR-Based Threshold and how to use?\""
   ]
